bun.lockb

# Tauri
**/src-tauri/target
**/src-tauri/binaries
**/src-tauri/resources/node
# 构建期产物（scripts/pack-builtin-skills.ts）；目录本身以 .gitkeep 入 git——
# tauri::generate_context! 编译期要求 bundle.resources 源路径存在（CI cargo test 不打包）
packages/client/desktop/src-tauri/resources/builtin-skills/*
!packages/client/desktop/src-tauri/resources/builtin-skills/.gitkeep
packages/client/desktop/packages/

# Test files
**/bubble_sort.py

# Design assets (prototypes with node_modules, .fig files)
design/product/prototype/node_modules/
design/product/*.fig

# User workspace (runtime data)
.ultrawork/

# OpenCode runtime config (generated by sidecar, not source code)
packages/client/desktop/config.json
opencode.json

# TypeScript build info
*.tsbuildinfo

# Commercialization docs (sensitive business strategy)
docs/discussions/002-commercialization.md

# e2e 走查截图（本地产物，不入库）
packages/client/desktop/e2e/*.png

# Python bytecode (local script runs must never enter the skill tree / pack hash)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# deckcraft example regression-chain output (2MB+ of pdf/pptx/png per run) —
# also excluded from the builtin-skills zip by pack/fetch-builtin-skills.ts
skills/builtin/*/examples/*/export/

# L3 真实语料（discussions/059 §5 L3，S5）：清单进 git，**字节不进 git**。
# ① 用户手上真实的中文办公文档多半是业务文件，而这棵树会被构建签名分发、git 历史永久；
# ② 第三方 PDF 的单件出处不因仓库 LICENSE 是 MIT 就自动干净 —— 不进源码树即无此问题；
# ③ 20MB 与构建无关的二进制测试数据不该进版本库。
# 默认落 ~/.cache/ultrawork/l3-corpus；CI 用 ULTRAWORK_L3_CORPUS 指到这里以便缓存。
.l3-corpus/
